      <h1 class="ed-title">Treadmill Black Friday Deals</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Late November is usually the strongest treadmill sale of the year, and also the week with the most creative arithmetic. A real deal is a lower delivered price on a machine you had already chosen. Everything else is presentation.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
